From: MrUnforsaken
Date: 2026-05-25
Subject: [PATCH 0013] Add advanced/expert settings GUI

Add collapsible "Advanced Settings" section to FaceSetting.tsx with controls for all advanced config values:
- Unsharp mask enable/disable + amount slider
- IR capture parameters (warmup, timeout, poll, attempts, AGC sleep, cam warmup)
- Anti-spoofing advanced (spoof class, combinational mode, debug save path)
- Detection advanced (input size, NMS IoU threshold slider)
- Capture resolution (width, height) + persistent preview FPS
- Enrollment capture count
- Recognition gallery path
- Auth max time

Persistent preview FPS: FaceCapture reads preview_fps from config and propagates changes back via onPreviewFpsChange callback.

